---
import { readFileSync } from 'node:fs';
import { join } from 'node:path';
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Crumbs from '../../components/Crumbs.astro';
import Photo from '../../components/Photo.astro';
import SectionNav from '../../components/SectionNav.astro';

const credits = JSON.parse(readFileSync(join(process.cwd(), 'public', 'photos', 'credits.json'), 'utf8')) as Record<string, { author?: string; license?: string }>;

function creditLine(id: string) {
  const credit = credits[id];
  return credit?.author ? `Photo: ${credit.author} · ${credit.license}` : '';
}

const description = 'Vietnam, in this guide, is a place of beauty and culture, a life lived in the open, and a turn toward what comes next.';
---
<Base title="About" description={description} path="/about" ogType="website" ogImage="/photos/ha-long.jpg">
  <article class="about-page section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <Crumbs items={[{ name: 'About' }]} />
      <h1>About</h1>
      <p class="lede">Vietnam, in this guide, is a place of beauty, of culture, of a life lived in the open, and of a turn from what has already happened toward what comes next.</p>

      <figure class="prose-figure about-hero">
        <a href="/ha-long">
          <Photo id="ha-long" alt="Ha Long Bay" priority />
        </a>
        <figcaption>
          <a href="/ha-long">Ha Long Bay</a>
          <span class="about-by">{creditLine('ha-long')}</span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <SectionNav
        label="About sections"
        items={[
          { id: 'landscape', label: 'Landscape' },
          { id: 'culture', label: 'Culture and making' },
          { id: 'daily', label: 'Daily life' },
          { id: 'forward', label: 'Looking forward' },
        ]}
      />

      <div class="place-body">
        <section id="landscape" class="place-section">
          <h2>Landscape</h2>
          <p>Start with the land. The photograph above is <a href="/ha-long">Ha Long Bay</a>: islands in still water, and a boat beside them. At Trang An, in <a href="/ninh-binh">Ninh Binh</a>, boats sit on a river under a cliff. Open either place when the shape of the country is the trip.</p>
          <figure class="prose-figure">
            <a href="/ninh-binh">
              <Photo id="blog-ninh-binh-trang-an" alt="Boats on the water at Trang An in Ninh Binh" />
            </a>
            <figcaption>
              <a href="/ninh-binh">Trang An, Ninh Binh</a>
              <span class="about-by">{creditLine('blog-ninh-binh-trang-an')}</span>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        </section>

        <section id="culture" class="place-section">
          <h2>Culture and making</h2>
          <p>Look for work you can stand beside. In Đa Phước, near <a href="/chau-doc">Chau Doc</a>, a weaver is at a loom, with blue cloth in front of her. In <a href="/hoi-an">Hoi An</a>, the street is hung with lanterns after dark. Follow the old-town pages when you want the person at the work, and the street after dark.</p>
          <div class="about-photos">
            <figure class="prose-figure">
              <a href="/chau-doc">
                <Photo id="about-chau-doc-loom" alt="A weaver at a loom in Đa Phước, near Chau Doc" />
              </a>
              <figcaption>
                <a href="/chau-doc">A weaver at a loom near Chau Doc</a>
                <span class="about-by">{creditLine('about-chau-doc-loom')}</span>
              </figcaption>
            </figure>
            <figure class="prose-figure">
              <a href="/hoi-an">
                <Photo id="hoi-an-lantern-night" alt="Lanterns over a street in Hoi An" />
              </a>
              <figcaption>
                <a href="/hoi-an">Lanterns in Hoi An</a>
                <span class="about-by">{creditLine('hoi-an-lantern-night')}</span>
              </figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="daily" class="place-section">
          <h2>Daily life</h2>
          <p>Give the ordinary hours a place in the day. At the floating market in <a href="/can-tho">Can Tho</a>, the stall is a boat, with cabbages in the bow. A bowl of <a href="/food/mi-quang">Mi Quang</a> is a meal set on a table. The food pages are there for that part of the trip.</p>
          <div class="about-photos">
            <figure class="prose-figure">
              <a href="/can-tho">
                <Photo id="blog-can-tho-market" alt="A seller with cabbages on a boat at the floating market in Can Tho" />
              </a>
              <figcaption>
                <a href="/can-tho">Floating market, Can Tho</a>
                <span class="about-by">{creditLine('blog-can-tho-market')}</span>
              </figcaption>
            </figure>
            <figure class="prose-figure">
              <a href="/food/mi-quang">
                <Photo id="mi-quang" alt="A bowl of Mi Quang" />
              </a>
              <figcaption>
                <a href="/food/mi-quang">Mi Quang <span class="vi">Mì Quảng</span></a>
                <span class="about-by">{creditLine('mi-quang')}</span>
              </figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="forward" class="place-section">
          <h2>Looking forward</h2>
          <p>The country is also what it is adding. <a href="/da-nang/dragon-bridge">Dragon Bridge</a> in Da Nang crosses the river in the shape of a dragon, with the city behind it. At <a href="/da-nang/my-khe">My Khe Beach</a> the towers stand along the sand. Come for that present, and leave room for the next visit to look different.</p>
          <div class="about-photos">
            <figure class="prose-figure">
              <a href="/da-nang/dragon-bridge">
                <Photo id="da-nang-dragon-bridge" alt="Dragon Bridge in Da Nang" />
              </a>
              <figcaption>
                <a href="/da-nang/dragon-bridge">Dragon Bridge, Da Nang</a>
                <span class="about-by">{creditLine('da-nang-dragon-bridge')}</span>
              </figcaption>
            </figure>
            <figure class="prose-figure">
              <a href="/da-nang/my-khe">
                <Photo id="da-nang-my-khe" alt="Towers along My Khe Beach in Da Nang" />
              </a>
              <figcaption>
                <a href="/da-nang/my-khe">My Khe Beach, Da Nang</a>
                <span class="about-by">{creditLine('da-nang-my-khe')}</span>
              </figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>

      <p class="note about-ratings"><a href="/about/ratings">How ratings work</a></p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .about-hero {
    margin-top: 3.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .about-hero :global(img) {
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    border-radius: 16px;
  }
  .about-by {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
  }
  .about-page .place-body > .place-section:first-child > h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .about-photos {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.15rem 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 3.5rem;
  }
  .about-photos .prose-figure {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .about-ratings {
    margin: 2.75rem 0 0.5rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .about-photos {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.75rem;
    }
  }
</style>
